 "```lean\ncase grind\nl : List Nat\nr : Nat\nh : sumDef l = r\n⊢ wp\n    (have acc := 0;\n    do\n    let __s ←\n      forIn l acc fun x __s =>\n          have acc := __s;\n          have acc := acc + x;\n          pure (ForInStep.yield acc)\n    have acc : Nat := __s\n    pure acc)\n    (fun r => r = l.sum) PUnit.unit\n```",
