{"rendered":
 "```lean\ncase vc1\nn i : Nat\na✝ :\n  have exit := true;\n  if exit = true then i = 0 else True\n⊢ i = 0\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc2\nn i✝ mb✝ : Nat\na✝ :\n  (Variant.ofMeasure fun i => i).EvalsTo i✝ mb✝ ⊓\n    have exit := false;\n    if exit = true then i✝ = 0 else True\nh✝ : 0 < i✝\ni : Nat := i✝ - 1\n⊢ (Variant.ofMeasure fun i => i).EvalsBelow i mb✝\n```\n---\n```lean\ncase vc3\nn i mb✝ : Nat\na✝ :\n  (Variant.ofMeasure fun i => i).EvalsTo i mb✝ ⊓\n    have exit := false;\n    if exit = true then i = 0 else True\nh✝ : ¬0 < i\n⊢ i = 0\n```",
